{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_06_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_06","title":"掙脫美夢","storyCode":"DV-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1b6d9661b7a31f8856f29bf34aba836bb0ee737ad4d87baecf45a5ac3c04e579","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"眾人發現，操縱神秘生物的其實是受試者集體的意識，這讓實驗的真正目的顯得更為可怖。塞雷婭推測出了斐爾迪南的野心，但幾人多次嘗試，仍未能與白面鴞同步。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的機器在黑暗之中沉默著。\n交錯的纜線就像蔓延的植物根莖，節點點綴著沉甸甸的苞芽。\n每一個苞芽都是一組發著微光的電極，從下方的生命體中汲取著養分。\n失蹤的拓荒者們頭戴電極，一個挨著一個，圍躺在一起。\n他們仍在正常呼吸，可彷彿對外面發生的一切都無知無覺。\n整間實驗室裡最顯眼的，是流淌在所有纜線裡，並彙集在最中央的儀器中的銀色液體。\n比起神態奇異的幾十名受試者，它才像是真正“活著”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......海倫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪克，蓋爾，索菲亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請小聲些，好不好？我們會嚇到他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，再等一等......等我解決眼前的小問題。一定會沒事的，朋友們，我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在對他們說話？他們恐怕聽不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的生命體徵，我只在昏迷的喬伊絲身上見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些電極和銀色液體......說不定正連接著他們的中樞神經系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多蘿西，為什麼......海倫也在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她擔心自己無法通過斐爾迪南的考核，於是我為她提供了一個建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建議......是指讓她也變成受試者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海倫早上還在和我們說笑，現在卻像根木頭似的躺在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想救她，埃琳娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感受到，她有多麼痛苦......就像我能感受到他們所有人的痛苦一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海倫的貸款幾乎拖垮了他們一整個家庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她每天都生活在恐慌中......假如斐爾迪南真的將她開除的話，她甚至會考慮結束自己的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是......我在這裡停下，他們只能回到最悲慘的命運之路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼忍心做這麼殘忍的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下你這些自以為是的發言，否則的話，我真的不保證自己不會在下一秒就射穿你的腦袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，你對我的憤恨，來自於你對眼前事物和對我的不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我理解你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你理解我們，所以準備“恩賜”給我們一些新的機會，讓我們除了死在天災下、死在野獸口中之外，再多一條路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在大公司的實驗室變成一具具勉強活著的屍體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼慷慨的提議！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己難道就沒有想過嗎，桑尼？為什麼......為什麼一樣是得了礦石病，有的人還能繼續工作，有的人卻只能背井離鄉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在醫院給出診斷之後的第二天，我就同時收到了保險合約和解雇通知書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保險合約有五百六十九頁，解雇通知書卻只有薄薄半張紙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有公司願意雇傭一名感染者，除非這名感染者能證明自己值得公司為他支付這筆巨額保險費——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道不覺得......這是多麼不公平？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這還用說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你也該理解我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聯繫不上赫默和格雷伊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基地恐怕完全被封閉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾......迪南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封閉實驗室只會是手段，而不是目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來斐爾迪南會在359號基地有大動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，赫默他們會有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們收不到任何基地內的資訊......是否立刻支援？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"白面鴞......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......九號裝置。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九號裝置的資料傳輸的確不同於正常通訊......只要信號有一瞬間的恢復，我們就能看到白面鴞看到的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我這就試著同步白面鴞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"......弗蘭克斯女士，您確定您要獨自一個人去見他？\n是的，我拿到了管理局的許可。\n我聽說那個叫洛肯·威廉姆斯的人是個瘋子，拿人體做很殘酷的實驗，被判了一百多年。\n我知道，我以前聽過他的講座。\n這些科學家是不是都挺瘋的？咳咳，抱歉，我忘了您也是......像您這樣溫柔端莊的女士，一定跟他們都不一樣。\n我明白，您只是想提醒我注意安全。我會小心的，謝謝。\n您預計會在裡面逗留多久？\n一個小時。有必要的話，我下周同一時間還會再過來一趟。\n你有這麼多想跟他聊的？他可不怎麼理會其他人啊......\n也許......是因為別人都是想向他索取什麼。而我......我想請求他幫我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都該獲得平等的機會，天賦的差異不該決定任何人的人生走向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當任何有天賦的人因為自己的天賦獲得特權的時候，他都在結果上侵佔了其他人的利益，破壞了公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是那個既得利益者，我為自己的“幸運”而羞愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡的每一個人......迪克，海倫，還有你，桑尼，我只是想在泥水將你們吞沒之前......拉住你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所做的一切努力，都是希望有一天......幸運只青睞足夠努力的人，而不再偏袒所謂的天賦者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年來，我一直在嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改造個體，來讓他們變得更強大，並不能解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天生強大的人，也能透過改造來變得更強，他們甚至還能搶佔先機，在新的賽道上拉出更大的鴻溝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要真正的平等，我只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想抹除個體的差距？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去意識的受試者......有情緒反應的源石技藝造物......這巨大的將他們連接在一起的儀器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你在做的實驗是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過類似的實驗，但我還以為這是早已失敗的狂想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......狂想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有哪一種技術本身是“瘋狂”的，技術只是實現不同理想的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"個體的差距與生俱來，我們不必忽視或者忘記它，但也不必一生受它所累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"透過我的技術，人們將能更平等地感受彼此，也將更平等地感受土地、空氣與雨水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"險隘將無法阻擋步伐，風暴也將不再遮蔽視線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必忍受跋涉之苦，不必與骨肉至親分離，人們就能更安全地眺望遠方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們難道看不見......這樣的未來有多美好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是不是從來都沒有真的搞明白過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這究竟是個什麼實驗啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，我們一直在找銀色造物背後的施術者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到剛才，我們都以為是這一個個拓荒者，其實並不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施術者是他們全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有一雙非常敏銳的眼睛，赫默醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗蘭克斯主任，你所描繪的未來只是......你的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我看到的......我看到的是另一番景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個源石技藝卓越的術師就能輕鬆摧毀一棟樓，三個卓越的術師能感知並控制一整個街區——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把幾十個、上百個乃至上千個人的力量融合起來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地上的每一個角落都將逃不脫它的“注視”，再堅固的堡壘也不過是它隨手就能捏碎的玩具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你所關心的這些人，你口中的朋友，他們在想要利用這技術的人眼中，永遠都只是實驗品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些失敗的......失敗的可能還好一些。那些人對失敗品沒興趣，願意放任他們自生自滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成功的“幸運兒”才是最不幸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從實驗成功的那一天起，他們就只能活在企業和政府的監控下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞......我從來沒見過你這樣......"},{"type":"narration","text":"這樣憤怒。\n赫默感覺到了自己的怒火，她的大腦嗡嗡作響，過往的一幕幕接二連三地浮現出來，將理性與修養撞得七零八落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實會改變他們的命運，可代價呢？他們會永遠失去自由，也失去自己的人生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會保護他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意付出我的生命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許在這裡殺了你，對所有人而言才是最安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是你們的最終決定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，千萬別衝動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......烏比卡博士，我沒有衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比任何時候都要清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多蘿西·弗蘭克斯......我必須承認，你描繪的未來很有吸引力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我差一點點就走進了你的實驗室......也許連你都不知道，我有多少次想拉住你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我的未來......應該是自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的言語，你的姿態......越讓我想要親近，我就越清醒地意識到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你正在控制我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要掙脫一個美夢......比掙脫噩夢更難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗蘭克斯主任，也許你也正在這個夢中，可我們要面對的卻是真正的現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生是對的，這樣的實驗，從頭到尾都不該存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片土地已經孕育出了足夠的瘋狂，像這樣瘋狂的主意，還是儘早埋葬更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我們全都要死在這裡......即便我要承擔最慘痛的後果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望類似的事情到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞，快勸勸桑尼呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何......多蘿西是想幫助這些受試者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......就算她應該被阻止，應該受到懲罰，也不該這樣......不該由這些她真心愛著的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......清醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要傷害弗蘭克斯主任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，同步失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......359號基地裡實驗的情況說不定比我們預想的還要嚴峻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你扶著我，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我終於能感覺到自己的腿了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"359號基地背後不止有萊茵生命。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"斐爾迪南與其他更大的勢力有合作。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南的合作對象，塞雷婭也很清楚吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你追蹤了那麼久的動力甲，最後只可能穿在最需要尖端武器的那些人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過那些人了，證據呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的溫柔果然是錯覺吧？為了搞到你想要的證據，我可是差點連命都搭上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一直以來的猜測都是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南已經不再隱藏自己的野心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斐爾迪南想要用這個實驗來換取支持......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後奪取萊茵生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須去找克麗斯騰，她才是斐爾迪南的第一目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭，你收到我發的最後一條消息了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我聯繫了萊茵的線人，他們說內部一切如常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為他們早就習慣了總轄不露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南籌謀了好幾年，一點點架空了總轄......這個實驗換來的籌碼將是最後一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，搞不好不是最後一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"在被抓住之前，我已經有一個多星期聯繫不上克麗斯騰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那基地那邊怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信赫默醫生的能力，她可是讓我吃過虧的人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及猶豫了哦，塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，這並不是一個選擇題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解決基地問題的前提是解決斐爾迪南，而解決斐爾迪南的方式正擺在我們面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走吧，去見一見萊茵總轄。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]}]}
